{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Rejoices</b> — one who rejoices in another's misfortune, the wicked one, shall not be cleared — neither of them will be cleared, for HaShem examines hearts and will render recompense to the wrongdoer and to the scorner and to the one who rejoices in another's misfortune."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:16.476633791Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}